k_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.8.dev (97dab7a63)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (97dab7a63) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors (3840x2160 @ 120.00 Hz, 3840x2160 @ 60.00 Hz) - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 63.11 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using the titles or sticky items the `panel/content_margin_top` causes the `Tree` to effectively have a margin at the top while it normally only adds the margin to the scrollable content. When both are active text is additionally cutoff after the last sticky item. I would expect items to become sticky only when the text reaches the top edge of the control and for the title to scroll until it reaches the top and then stay there.\n\n|  |  Without title | With title | \n|-----|----|----|\n| Without sticky items | <img height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee33b368-cebb-4049-9b9b-bf24ad2fe869\" /> | <img height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee179ee5-27d5-4e56-b42f-b356e143ae68\" /> |\n| With sticky items | <img height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/509c97de-352d-4e47-b30b-a00cc23d7613\" /> | <img height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6227cb03-d062-43c6-9fe9-f67369ef966c\" /> |\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a scene with a `Tree` and fill it with content, I used:\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Tree\n\n@export_tool_button(\"build\") var build = _generate_tree\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    _generate_tree()\n\nfunc _generate_tree() -> void:\n    clear()\n    columns = 10\n    set_column_title(0, \"Test\")\n    var prev = create_item()\n    for i in range(30):\n        for j in range(columns):\n            prev.set_text(j, \"test\".repeat(200))\n        prev = create_item(prev)\n```\n- Change `panel/content_margin_top`\n- Change `column_titles_visible` and `theme_override_constants/scroll_max_sticky_items` depending on what scenario you want to test\n- Run the scene and scroll in the `Tree` to see the issue\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123609/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123609/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}